{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30279","headline":"送同年郑祥先辈归汉南 · 薛逢","name":"送同年郑祥先辈归汉南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年来惊喜两心知，高处同攀次第枝。\n人倚绣屏闲赏夜，马嘶花径醉归时。\n声名本自文章得，藩溷曾劳笔砚随。\n家去恩门四千里，只应从此梦旌旗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30279.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30279","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}